obably year and a half couple years  until my language got up to speed and I  sort of started to have more of that  understanding and that was a five year  old imagine as a 15 year old or as a 25  year old or as a 35 year old being  dropped into a country where you lack  the language the culture and that shared  sort of community history and it becomes  very obvious why many times immigrants  will exist mostly within communities of  people from the country they came from  or the religion they came from or some  other shared ideology because it is  extraordinarily difficult and obviously  being however many thousands of miles  Massachusetts is from Argentina what is  it six five six thousand miles something  like that don't remember now just being  far from family was also extraordinarily  difficult so yeah I mean Brittany I  think you're on to something that is  really important which is the framing of  immigrants as people who are abruptly  and uncaring ly leaving for the most  part the one place they've known the one  country they've lived in the entire  lives merely to try to show up and suck  up government welfare benefits or commit  crimes or whatever  these are life-altering major major  decisions and we should always remember  that that's the case we have a great  bonus show coming up for you today we  will talk about Sarah Huckabee Sanders  being completely unable to name a single  fake news outlet food stamps for soda is  it time to end the billion dollar  subsidy for sugary drinks I think that  it is and a story about a same-sex  couple carrying what some are calling a  miracle baby that some are saying is the  world's first all of those stories and  much more on today's bonus show I hope  you will please sign up please become a  member because membership is the number  one funding source for the program you  can get access to the bonus show by  signing up at www.movinon.com  slash david pakman show
 

